+### Zeo's own UI strings, in the language every id is written against.
+###
+### Rules (docs/I18N-PROPOSAL.md in zeo-workspace, "Writing rules"):
+### - ids are kebab-case and start with the crate that shows them
+###   (agent-sandbox-hide-host); changing the English never changes the id;
+### - a tooltip or a note is an attribute of its message (.tooltip, .note);
+### - numbers, paths and names are variables, in snake_case ({ $folder_name });
+###   plurals are resolved here, never by building a sentence in code.
+###
+### Every id in this file must be used, and every id used must be here:
+### zed-patches/scripts/i18n-check.py checks both.
